		<p _msttexthash=3D"28674269" _msthash=3D"1095">You also can buy <a href=
=3D"https://computer.howstuffworks.com/usb.htm">USB</a> keys that plug in t=
o use as wireless adapters. These devices, which resemble the memory sticks=
 or <a href=3D"https://computer.howstuffworks.com/flash-memory.htm">flash d=
rives</a> you stick into an available USB port on the side of your computer=
, seem to be an increasingly popular choice.</p>

	=09
=09
			=09
			=09
=09


=09
		<p _msttexthash=3D"35510020" _msthash=3D"1096">Yet another type of wirele=
ss Internet card exists for <a href=3D"https://electronics.howstuffworks.co=
m/gadgets/travel/pda.htm">PDAs</a>. For people who haven't yet jumped on th=
e <a href=3D"https://electronics.howstuffworks.com/blackberry.htm">BlackBer=
ry</a> bandwagon, there is <b>WCF</b>. <b>Wireless CompactFlash</b> cards, =
like PC Cards, fit into a slot on the side or back of a PDA and enable it t=
o communicate with the Internet.</p>

	=09
=09
			=09
			=09
=09


=09
		<p _msttexthash=3D"6427889" _msthash=3D"1097">The variations in wireless =
Internet cards don't stop there. Learn about some of the other differences =
next.</p>

	=09
=09
