=09


=09
		<p _msttexthash=3D"169405834" _msthash=3D"1107">In addition, don't forget=
 to look at the card's transfer rate, range and the <a href=3D"https://comp=
uter.howstuffworks.com/operating-system.htm">operating system</a> it requir=
es. Also, consider whether you want a card with an external or internal ant=
enna. Last but not least is security. Wireless networks are notoriously eas=
ier to hack into than wired ones, which means you have to take extra measur=
es to protect yourself. The Wi-Fi Alliance suggests always connecting throu=
gh a trusted provider that uses encryption technologies, enabling security =
if you have your own network and buying products that are WiFi-certified fo=
r <b>WiFi Protected Access (WPA)</b>.</p>

	=09
=09
			=09
			=09
=09


=09
		<p _msttexthash=3D"46761273" _msthash=3D"1108">Wireless technology shows =
no signs of stopping its quest to allow you to check your <a href=3D"https:=
//computer.howstuffworks.com/e-mail-messaging/email.htm">e-mail</a> anytime=
, anywhere. Soon you may even be able to surf the net while flying at 30,00=
0 feet (9,144 meters). For more on wireless technology, including where to =
find the nearest hot spot, try some of the links on the next page.</p>

	=09
=09
			=09
			=09
=09

				=09
<div id=3D"sidebar-page3-el32" class=3D"sidebar-section lazyload bg-tan p-6=
 mb-6">
						<div class=3D"text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-2 text-royal-blue" _msttexthash=
=3D"113217" _msthash=3D"1109">Evil Twin</div>
				<p class=3D"text-base" _msttexthash=3D"72311928" _msthash=3D"1110">No, =
this is not your naughty alter ego, but a security threat you face every ti=
